                {
                  "id": "h-common-costs",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Common Dry Van Trailer Maintenance Costs",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "common-costs"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-common-costs-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "While every operation is different, most dry vans require attention in the same key areas.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-common-costs-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "cost",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Tires and Wheel Components",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Load weight"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Road conditions"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Alignment issues"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Tire pressure maintenance"
                          }
                        ],
                        "intro": "Tires are one of the most common maintenance expenses for trailers. Factors that affect tire life include:",
                        "outro": "Replacing trailer tires can cost several hundred dollars per tire, depending on brand and specifications. Regular inspections and proper inflation help extend tire life."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Brake System Maintenance",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Brake pad replacement"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Drum or rotor inspections"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Air brake system checks"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Slack adjuster adjustments"
                          }
                        ],
                        "intro": "Brake components are critical for safety and compliance. Routine brake maintenance includes:",
                        "outro": "Ignoring brake maintenance can lead to safety violations or equipment downtime, which often costs more than preventive repairs."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Suspension and Axle Repairs",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Bushings"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Air bags"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Springs"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Shock absorbers"
                          }
                        ],
                        "intro": "Trailer suspension systems absorb the stress of long-distance hauling. Over time, common wear items include:",
                        "outro": "Maintaining these components ensures smoother rides and protects cargo during transport."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Trailer Flooring and Interior Repairs",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Replacing damaged boards"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Reinforcing high-traffic areas"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Repairing forklift damage"
                          }
                        ],
                        "intro": "Many dry van trailers carry palletized freight, which puts significant pressure on flooring systems. Floor maintenance may involve:",
                        "outro": "Keeping flooring in good condition helps prevent cargo damage and ensures safe loading operations."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Doors, Seals, and Structural Components",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Door hinge repairs"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Seal replacements"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Latch adjustments"
                          }
                        ],
                        "intro": "Rear doors and seals take constant abuse from daily loading and unloading. Maintenance may include:",
                        "outro": "These smaller repairs often go unnoticed but play a major role in protecting freight and keeping trailers operational."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-common-costs-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing equipment with the right design and specifications can reduce long-term maintenance costs. Compare available models and review detailed specifications before making your next equipment decision.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
