                {
                  "id": "h-plan-ahead",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Plan Ahead and Keep Your Trailer Working",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "plan-ahead"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-plan-ahead-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Understanding dry van trailer maintenance costs helps operators plan smarter and protect their investment. From tires and brakes to structural components, staying ahead of maintenance ensures your trailer stays productive and compliant for the long haul. If you're evaluating dry vans for your fleet, reviewing specifications and build quality is one of the best ways to predict long-term ownership costs. At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, our team is ready to help you compare options and find equipment that fits your operation.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
